   "id": "sprite-walk",
   "explanation": "The sprite clip: Body, a Sprite2D on Bao's pc_sheet.png sliced by hframes 10 and an offset that puts cell pixel (16, 23) on the courier's origin; the walk clip keys Body:frame 2 at 0 and 3 at 8/60 s, discrete, nearest, LOOP_LINEAR, step 1/60, plus one-key clips for the other cells; the sheet's credits.",
   "beat_ids": [
    "B04",
