    "animations/courier_clips.tres"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "state-machine",
   "explanation": "One authority: player.gd's visual state machine (override > dash > hurt > cast > walk > idle) picks the clip and a time from tick counters, and _show() alone plays and seeks the manual-mode AnimationPlayer; the dash phases advance from dash_ticks on the 60 Hz tick; take_hit applies Bao's interrupt rule per phase; the dash action, the card and the dash timings live in session.gd, progression.gd and tuning.gd.",
   "beat_ids": [
    "B10",
    "B11",
    "B12",
    "B13"
   ],
   "files": [
    "features/player/player.gd",
    "game/session.gd",
