   "explanation": "The pins (test_courier_pin.gd before the change; test_courier_pin_input.gd through real input, verified on 9ccf078), the read-back test_courier_clips.gd (the assignment's track_problems, key times, step, loop, discrete, cells inside the sheet, seam, phase boundaries, rig regions, outline), the structure test, the dash edge tests at 30/60/144 fps with the two-clocks measurement, the Godot 3 names and headless probes, the wrapper's resource-load fixture, the shared harness and the earlier suites run unchanged.",
